展示臺灣的技術實力與研發成果。 身兼協會理事長的李允立也在論壇中代表錼創科技分享Micro LED於光通訊領域的應用潛力。此舉充分展現臺灣光電技術的跨域整合實力，並藉由海外交流平台爭取更多國際合作商機。 在技術合作方面，工研院攜手立碁電子、千才科技以及荷蘭PHIX等產業夥伴，藉由臺荷國際聯合研發計畫加速推進技術進程。雙方團隊聚焦開發下一世代高速矽光子光收發模組，積極整合矽光子晶片、雷射光源與先進光電封裝等關鍵環節。 立碁電子於本次PIC Summit展示1.6T LPO光收發模組的階段性研發成果，並規劃後續朝3.2T高速光收發模組目標邁進。","sentiment":1,"tags":{"topics":["AI/半導體"],"bull":["合作","供應鏈"],"bear":[],"score":2,"highlights":[],"keywords":["錼創","立碁","LED","MicroLED","光通訊"]},"time":"11/04 15:55"}],"fund":{"code":"8111","rev_month":"11510","rev":81823.0,"rev_mom":12.052532113609598,"rev_yoy":14.06923087646903,"rev_cum_yoy":-3.3763615158044558,"eps_q":0.49,"eps_year":"115","eps_season":"3","net_income":54064.0,"pe":93.9,"pb":6.03,"yield":0.78,"updated":"2026-11-13 17:58"},"tdcc":{"latest":{"date":"2026-11-06","big1000":24.5,"big400":33.17,"retail":33.42,"holders":61511},"prev":{"date":"2026-10-30","big1000":24.55,"big400":33.89,"retail":33.24,"holders":61242},"d_big1000":-0.05,"d_big400":-0.72,"d_retail":0.18,"d_holders":269},"weekly":{"bars":[{"time":"2026-07-27","open":59.9,"high":69.0,"low":56.2,"close":56.3,"volume":124907.141},{"time":"2026-08-03","open":56.1,"high":69.0,"low":54.3,"close":59.4,"volume":61579.081000000006},{"time":"2026-08-10","open":58.0,"high":60.0,"low":55.3,"close":55.5,"volume":14853.665},{"time":"2026-08-17","open":55.5,"high":66.0,"low":54.2,"close":65.0,"volume":27484.689},{"time":"2026-08-24","open":65.0,"high":67.5,"low":61.1,"close":62.4,"volume":44108.638000000006},{"time":"2026-08-31","open":62.4,"high":82.8,"low":62.2,"close":70.0,"volume":147261.00300000003},{"time":"2026-09-07","open":72.4,"high":75.5,"low":68.9,"close":71.7,"volume":50870.947},{"time":"2026-09-14","open":70.1,"high":79.6,"low":67.6,"close":78.0,"volume":57933.09},{"time":"2026-09-21","open":80.9,"high":83.9,"low":73.8,"close":76.4,"volume":72922.922},{"time":"2026-09-29","open":76.4,"high":85.8,"low":76.2,"close":85.8,"volume":50767.42},{"time":"2026-10-05","open":90.4,"high":99.7,"low":86.5,"close":93.7,"volume":116970.9